WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.1 · Financial Management
Finance roles and the finance cycle

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Separate doing, recording and overseeing your money, and run them in a steady cycle.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name who budgets, records, pays, reports and oversees.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Use a qualified accountant for statutory accounts and tax.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Put monthly and annual finance dates in your calendar.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: Ibu Made keeps the cash book; Sari buys; spending over US$100 needs both co-founders; receipts checked monthly.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your finance roles and monthly and annual cycle.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
